# Rust build output and native binaries -- previously unprotected here
# (no .gitignore existed in this subfolder at all before patch 0405),
# a real gap given `target/` alone can run to gigabytes. The compiled
# platform binaries under dist/ are already covered by the root
# .gitignore's bare `dist` pattern; this covers the rest.
target/
*.node
node_modules/
